      "foaf:homepage": "https://nccrdataplatform.ccdi.cancer.gov/data-browser/MCE",
      "dct:description": "Patient enrollment data extracted from medical claims collected by various insurers. Includes details about each patient's insurance enrollment status at various points in time before and after their index cancer diagnosis. Enrollment status known only for years 2000-2023, for patients with SEER diagnosis year 2000-2021.",
